<title>JAPAN: Dell aims for high Japan PC market growth.</title>
<headline>Dell aims for high Japan PC market growth.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dell Computer Corp chairman Michael Dell told Reuters on Tuesday that the company aims for growth in Japan which is 2-3 times higher than the rate of growth in the Japanese personal computer market.  </p>
<p>&quot;If the market is growing by 20 percent, we would like to grow by 40 to 60 percent,&quot; the visiting chairman told Reuters after an executive luncheon at a Tokyo hotel.</p>
<p>He also said that the company will boost its staff in Japan by two to three times its current level in the next 3-4 years.</p>
</text>
